  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The group banners above the name tags are too big and not transparent. It really doesn't need to include the name and the code. The name is usually already in the banner. Banner should be cut in about half and be transparent like the rest of the name tag (edit: this has been fixed now). Really hope this is just temporary cause it doesn't fit, it shouldn't take up more space than your own name.\n\nAlso there is a bug where the banner will be cropped different for different people. Or it depends on something I’m not aware of, but it should still look the same for everyone so you can edit it to look good for everyone.",
